[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><p>1. Remove the front hub (1a) from the steering knuckle (1b) using\na press (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035103.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. Position the front wheel hub in a vice.</p><p>2. Move the bearing inner race away from the hub, using a chisel,\nto allow the extractor arms to be fitted.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>When carrying out this operation,\ntake the utmost care not to damage the front wheel hub.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035104.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. Remove the front hub bearing inner race using the tool (1a) fitted\nwith components (1b) and (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.840.005.003</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Extractor Arms</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.840.005.302</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Pad</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.845.028.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035105.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) fixing the dust shield (1b) from the front\nhub steering knuckle.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035106.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. Place the front hub in a vice.</p><p>2. Remove the front hub bearing circlip.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035107.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. Remove the front hub bearing from the steering knuckle (1a) using\na press (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035108.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]